<title>THAILAND: Thai Feb trade deficit narrows.</title>
<headline>Thai Feb trade deficit narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday Thailand's trade deficit narrowed to 21.7 billion baht in February from a revised 39.0 billion in January and against 31.5 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE     Feb 97     Jan 97	 Feb 96</p>
<p>	  Exports		108.6     115.9	 114.9</p>
<p>	  Imports		130.3     154.9	 146.4</p>
<p>	  Trade balance	-21.7     -39.0	 -31.5</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok Newsroom (662)-652-0642</p>
</text>
